(FastAPI & Modern Python Web Guide) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Chapter 1: Introduction to FastAPI) Tj
T*
(FastAPI is a modern, fast \(high-performance\) web framework) Tj
T*
(for building APIs with Python 3.8+ based on standard Python type hints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Key Highlights:) Tj
T*
(- Fast: Very high performance, on par with NodeJS and Go) Tj
T*
(- Fast to code: Increases speed to develop features by 200% to 300%) Tj
T*
(- Fewer bugs: Reduces about 40% of developer induced errors) Tj
T*
(- Intuitive: Great editor support, auto-completion everywhere) Tj
T*
(- Easy: Designed to be easy to use and learn) Tj
T*
(- Standards-based: Based on OpenAPI and JSON Schema) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Page 1 of 3) Tj
