(Chapter 2: Production Deployment on Render.com) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Deploying FastAPI on Render.com is simple and powerful:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Web Service Configuration:) Tj
T*
(   - Environment: Python 3.12) Tj
T*
(   - Build Command: pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
T*
(   - Start Command: uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Environment Variables:) Tj
T*
(   - Set SECRET_KEY for secure cookie sessions) Tj
T*
(   - Connect managed PostgreSQL or SQLite) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Mobile Responsiveness:) Tj
T*
(   - The mobile-first reader provides smooth PDF canvas rendering) Tj
T*
(   - Touch zoom, dark mode, and page bookmarks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
